# GotongHR stack

- Runtime is Node 22.13 or newer. Package manager is pnpm. Build graph is Turborepo.
- Apps are Vite and Fastify. Do not add Next.js, Redis, Prisma, or a headless browser.
- Money is integer rupiah in `bigint`. The UI formats it. The UI does not compute tax.
- `packages/payroll-engine` does no database, network, or LLM work.
- A module imports another module only through a port in `packages/contracts`.
- An LLM tool does not write domain tables. It writes a proposal.
- PostgreSQL roles used at request time do not have `BYPASSRLS`.
